    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "mCI03",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Hero interaction spec",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 520,
      "content": "HERO v2 · interaction spec (for apps/landing)\n\nLayout: hero = 100% of the viewport. Hills fill the bottom 25-30%; the copy sits centred on the front hill.\n\nLayers (back to front): sky, far hill, mid hill, Mind (landing/mind-cutout.png, the v0.3 base art), front hill, copy, nav. A peeking pose with hands on the crest needs a new image.\n\n1. Idle: the Mind peeks over the front hill, hands resting on the crest; gentle breathing.\n2. Mouse move: head and eyes follow the cursor (small head tilt, pupils move).\n3. Mouse over the face: the Mind rises up from behind the hill to show its whole face, then sinks back when the cursor leaves.\n4. Click: a random emoji / expression each click (happy, surprised, wink, sleepy, thinking...).\n\nThe Mind image is a placeholder cut from design/generated-10.png; the hills are vectors and will be replaced by Nabil's generated art.\nNav: no testnet badge."
    }
